OL,3,GNEWSADPD working with Home Office after
OL,4,Aimmigration raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FParcel delivery firm DPD says it is
OL,7,Fworking with the Home Office after
OL,8,Fthree people were arrested on its
OL,9,Fpremises during an immigration raid.
OL,11,FThree Indian nationals suspected of not
OL,12,Fhaving the right to work in the UK were
OL,13,Farrested on Monday in a joint operation
OL,14,Fbetween immigration enforcement
OL,15,Fofficers and Lincolnshire Police at the
OL,16,Fcompany's warehouse in Witham St Hughs.
OL,18,FThe BBC understands two were asylum
OL,19,Fseekers and one had overstayed their
OL,20,Fvisa.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
